1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,382
This ship-cleaning demo ships a
language its store page doesn't sell.

2
00:00:04,632 --> 00:00:08,100
Vietnamese. It's in the build.
It's not on the page.

3
00:00:10,350 --> 00:00:14,889
It's Seaside Wash.
You scrape barnacles and rust off wrecked ships.

4
00:00:15,139 --> 00:00:19,573
Six hundred and nine megabytes.
A hundred and ninety-one files.

5
00:00:19,823 --> 00:00:24,780
It's Unity on Mono,
so the localization tables sit there with their names on them.

6
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:32,494
English, Japanese, Korean, Simplified and Traditional Chinese.
And Vietnamese, which the page never mentions.

7
00:00:32,894 --> 00:00:38,347
Somebody already translated the whole thing.
So either it's coming, or it got cut.

8
00:00:38,747 --> 00:00:43,129
Worth a dip. Every demo I open,
I read the file list first.
